        "modern_text": "侧脑水星穴格，包含窝穴、钳穴、乳穴、突穴四种类型，各类型对应图示如下：<table><tr><td>窝穴</td><td>钳穴</td><td>乳穴</td><td>突穴</td></tr><tr><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/e4f2b8db853d83d6254a94c9fab0f738522b0cc4a021a88059a00c82deb4e4e5.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/5dc9987444c2aed9f4059d3d6f1eed3c8cb5e0e76fa5a92a6756d8af6accb0c9.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/ec65e9391659e799442d9f5171ae9214475f7a321c0fa332dc739003d35156b6.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/99f6a1ab11567d78571597c84984b614b133cdeff132c13e8532e9837b259e2b.jpg\"/></td></tr></table>",
